* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
*PHYSICS           1.                                                  IONBRPAI
*IONTRANS    HEAVYION
EMF                                                                   EMF-OFF
*EMFCUT          1E-2      1E-2                      @LASTREG
*EMFCUT          1E-5      1E-5            BERYLLIU  BERYLLIU        1.PROD-CUT
*BIASING           1.                 1.0    T2HEAD                    PRINT
*BIASING          0.0                 5.0  T2INSHLD                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.                10.0    T2COLL                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.                10.0  AIRBEFB3                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0    B3TVac                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0  AIRBEFB2                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0  B2B3Spec                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0   AIRBEFD                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0      DEGR                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0  AIRAFTER                    PRINT
*BIASING           1.               100.0   NA61exp                    PRINT
* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME
    0    0          
#if 0
* Black body
SPH world      0.0 0.0 0.0 1200.0
#endif
#if 0
* Void sphere
SPH around     0.0 0.0 0.0 1000.0
#endif
RPP world      -300. 300. -300. 300. -500. 3500.
RPP around     -80 80. -150. 150 -300. 2300
#if 0
* T2 target head :160mm wide, 2mm height, [40, 100,180,300,500] mm long
RPP T2         -8. 8. -0.1 0.1 -15. 15.
#endif
RPP tcoll      -15. 15. -7.5 7.5 64.9 105.1
RCC T2         0.0 0.0 -50 0.0 0.0 70. 1.0
RPP t2insh     -42. 42. -40. 40. -65. 65.
RPP t2outsh    -60. 60. -120. 120. -105. 105.
* Dummy air - over estimated by 0.5 m
RPP AIRFIRST   -60. 60. -120. 120. 105.1 165.0
* Magnets Kit : y=690 mm, x=1200 mm
RPP MTNHo1     -60.0 60.0 -34.5 34.5 165. 525.
RPP MTNHv1     -20.0 20. -3. 3. 165. 525.
RPP MTNHo2     -60. 60. -34.5 34.5 585. 945.
RPP MTNHv2     -20. 20. -3. 3. 585. 945.
* Air Before B2B3 region
RPP airbefb2   -20. 20. -3. 3. 945.1 950.0
* First beam spectrometer
RPP B2B3       -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 950.1 951.0
* Air Before Degrader
RPP airbefd    -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 951.0 951.1
* Degrader : Polyethylene, Thickness 40 mm
RPP Degr       -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 951.1 955.1
* Air After Degrader
RPP airafter   -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 955.1 955.2
* Second beam spectrometer & Experiment
RPP NA61       -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 955.2 957.
RPP VXSS       -20.0 20.0 -3. 3. 958. 2200
* BEFTAX
RPP BEFTAX     -20. 20. -34.5 34.5 2198 2199
END
* Black hole
BLKBODY      5 +world -around
* Void around
VOID         5 +around -airafter -airbefd -airbefb2  -t2outsh -AIRFIRST -tcoll -MTNHo1 -MTNHo2  -B2B3 -Degr -NA61
               -VXSS-BEFTAX
T2SHILD      5 +t2outsh -t2insh -tcoll
T2INSHLD     5 +t2insh-tcoll -T2
T2HEAD       5 +T2
T2COLL       5 +tcoll
B3TFe        5 +MTNHo1-MTNHv1 | +MTNHo2 -MTNHv2
B3TVac       5 +MTNHv1 | +MTNHv2
B2B3Spec     5 +B2B3
DEGR         5 +Degr
NA61exp      5 +NA61
VXSS         5 VXSS-BEFTAX
BEFTAX       5 +BEFTAX
AIRBEFB2     5 +airbefb2
AIRBEFD      5 +airbefd
AIRAFTER     5 +airafter
AIRBEFB3     5 +AIRFIRST
END
GEOEND
LOW-MAT     GRAPHITE        6.       -3.      296.                    CARBON
